  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It is absolutely insane to me that we don't have some sort of content filter for worlds and avatars to warn sensitive users about flashing lights, extreme contrast, intrusive post processing, etc. I personally have issues with this as I will get nausea and migraines from this sort of content. People have already been having seizures in VRChat regularly from places and avatars that don't self-disclose this information. The community has been rather generous with their self-disclosures, but there's still tons of content out there that has no warnings and you won't know it's there until it's too late.\n\nMy request is to please make an enforced photosensitivity content filter for worlds and avatars for the safety of everyone using the same system as the other content filters already in place.",
